description.narrative:
In support of the Office of the United Nations High Commissioner for Human Rights (OHCHR) Innovation and Analytics Hub (IAH), UNOPS will aim to hellp OHCHR leverage data, digital technologies, and innovation for the following
outcomes:
1) To strengthen data management capabilities for Human Rights including in line with the OHCHR’s Digital Transformation Roadmap;
2) To strengthen analytics capabilities for Human Rights in line with the OHCHR’s Digital Transformation Roadmap;
3) To enhance Human Rights risk analysis for early warning and prevention.
